  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 075647b5037b94665af7ab98ee693d4b, type: 2}
    text: Its so sad that this park is set for destruction to make way for a shopping
      mall.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 075647b5037b94665af7ab98ee693d4b, type: 2}
    text: Ever since the last house was destroyed by the Stage Manager, I've given
      up on saving this place.
